Package: devstats
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: DevStats contributors <devstats@localhost>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6 (>= 9), libgcc-s1, libqt5core5a (>= 5.12), libqt5gui5 (>= 5.12), libqt5widgets5 (>= 5.12), libqt5network5 (>= 5.12), libqt5sql5 (>= 5.12), libqt5dbus5 (>= 5.12), libqt5sql5-sqlite (>= 5.12)
Recommends: qtwayland5 (>= 5.12), libglib2.0-bin
Description: Desktop system monitor with stall diagnosis
 DevStats monitors CPU, memory, disk, networking and processes, finds out why
 the desktop stalls, and can end chosen programs when they run or exceed a CPU
 limit. Built for ARM64 Linux desktops with Qt 5 and glibc 2.31, including
 Kylin Desktop V10.
